        '<div class="concept"><p class="concept-term">调整浪 A-B-C</p><span class="concept-en">A-B-C Correction</span><p>五浪走完后的三浪回撤。浪 A 下跌、浪 B 反弹诱多、浪 C 真正杀跌。</p></div>',
